# Match Polls (MVP)

Every confirmed match has exactly two polls:

1. **Availability** — playing / not playing
2. **Carpool** — carpool vs coming on own

## Rules

- One vote per member per poll; latest wins until freeze
- Players change votes freely until **match day − 1**
- After freeze: Admin-only edits
- Everyone (Admin + Player) can see who opted in so far
- Max 12 available; soft target min 11

## Carpool fee

- Carpool = **₹100** per player for to-and-fro
- Added on top of match fee share at settlement

## Repository / service

- Repository: CRUD only
- Service: freeze rules, squad caps, notification triggers
